---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Layout
  site={site}
  page="Privacy"
  description="Billsnap stores invoices in your browser. We do not run an account database."
>
  <main class="section prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Billsnap is a static website. Invoice contents, logos, and saved drafts are written to
      <strong>localStorage in your browser</strong>. They are not uploaded to a Billsnap server
      because there is not one.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you connect a checkout link later (Stripe, Polar, Lemon Squeezy), that provider processes
      the Pro payment under their privacy policy. Billsnap does not receive card numbers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Clearing this site’s data in your browser deletes drafts. Print or download a PDF if you need
      a copy that survives that.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 20 August 2026.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
